  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MENA: Convenings on Libya Conference 2018</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objectives of the conference is threefold:
1. Take stock of the implementation if the UN Action Plan for Libya;
2. Assess the situation in Libya in a broader regional perspective;
3. Discuss possibilities for an increased Danish and European strategic engagement in Libya within the humanitarian-stabilization-development nexus.</narrative>
  </description>
